ATTRIBUTION
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------

The reference material under skills/clj-design/guide/ is a condensed,
source-faithful distillation of:

    Elements of Clojure, by Zachary Tellman
    https://elementsofclojure.com

reproduced and adapted with the author's permission. The design insights are
Zachary Tellman's. The condensation, the seven lenses, the code-time checks, and
the skill scaffolding are by crinklywrappr. Any errors introduced by the
condensation are not the author's.

If you reuse this work, credit both:
    - Zachary Tellman, "Elements of Clojure" (https://elementsofclojure.com)
    - crinklywrappr, "clj-design" (https://github.com/crinklywrappr/clj-design)

If you find this useful, buy the book. It is excellent, and far richer than any
condensation.
